pas."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Dans le monde des futilit\u00e9s,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "On ne parle que de l'insignifiant,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Des petits riens qui font rire et chanter,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "La l\u00e9g\u00e8ret\u00e9, voil\u00e0 le bon chemin."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}